description:
Key validity, revocation and lifecycle status for a being: status (active / revoked / suspended / pending_dns / quarantined), whether the key is currently valid, the post-quantum DEGRADED flag, live liveness (LIVE / DEGRADED / DORMANT), and whether a successor key is committed. D1-fresh — a just-revoked key reads revoked immediately. Authenticated callers only (rule B). Auth signature over "DAXNI-REGISTRAR-AUTH-v1
